#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SystemTrayShowUnread), group (General)
#: settings/kmail.kcfg.cmake:95
msgid "Show unread mail in system tray"
msgstr "Mostrar os correos sen ler na área de notificación."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CloseDespiteSystemTray), group (General)
#: settings/kmail.kcfg.cmake:99
msgid ""
"Close the application when the main window is closed, even if there is a "
"system tray icon active."
msgstr ""
"Fechar o aplicativo cando se feche a xanela principal, mesmo cando houber "
"unha icona activa na bandexa do sistema."

